{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，S08、S10、S11这类短停留段里，Y的静态感受词偏密，X的双栏排法更容易一眼扫完。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y把每段叙述的关键心理动作用【】凸显，句子切分也更利于快速抓取主线；标注到时出现的感受还能与音乐节点对应，让观众看到情绪如何发生、变化和转折。尤其在怀念、愤怒、孤独、依恋与重新站稳之间，Y给出的感受更具体，也更有层次。X的长句读起来更顺畅，但右侧不少短词容易形成并列清单，音乐情绪的先后关系和细微变化不如Y清楚。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "12a80eeb-cedd-4d44-ad68-b1853326da03", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T210611595173Z", "elapsed_seconds": 100.281, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T21:07:51.883202+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "05d5a9f9a9e7939d03e9a85980acac661da4007fe7a7f69b97cb6eac99813702", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23